#. type: Plain text
#: en/git-shortlog.adoc:58
#, fuzzy, placeholders:'`--group`', priority:260
#| msgid "Group commits based on `<type>`. If no `--group` option is specified, the default is `author`. `<type>` is one of:"
msgid "Group commits based on _<type>_. If no `--group` option is specified, the default is `author`. _<type>_ is one of:"
msgstr "Gruppincheckningar baserade på `<typ>`. Om inget `--group`-alternativ anges är standardvärdet `author`. `<typ>` är en av:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/git-shortlog.adoc:61
#, priority:260
